window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b><i>What do you do when you thought it was all over, only to realize it's all just begun?</i></b></p> <p><i>I died. </i></p> <p>I looked into Rogan Kendrick’s eyes, told him I loved him…and then I died.</p> <p>So how the hell am I standing naked in the middle of a morgue, doing my best not to freak the fuck out?</p> <p>I’m a Bone Witch, or at least I was before Rogan bound us together. Blood magic now flows through my veins too, and I think somehow the man I shouldn’t love, the one who betrayed me, who couldn’t choose me…has saved me.</p> <p>If the High Council finds out they’ll hunt us, and they won’t be the only ones. A certain bastard demon did promise to <i>see me soon.</i></p> <p>I don’t know exactly what the hell is going on, but I do know this: My name is Lennox Osseous, and it’s time to show them why you don’t f--k with the Bone Witch.</p>"; 
